      "problem": "What is the infimum of the set $A=\\{0,\\,3,\\,6,\\,9\\}?$\n\n$inf(A)=$\n{{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "The infimum of a set $A$ is the greatest lower bound of $A.$\n\nIf $A$ is a finite set, the infimum of $A$ equals its minimum. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}inf(A) & =min\\{0,\\,3,\\,6,\\,9\\}=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
